TIGunTemplate.description.HypervelocityKineticCannon_Maelstrom=Unbridled rage embodied in the Hypervelocity Kinetic Cannon "Maelstrom".
TIGunTemplate.displayName.HypervelocityKineticCannon_Maelstrom_Two=Hypervelocity Kinetic Cannon "Maelstrom". Version Two
TIGunTemplate.description.HypervelocityKineticCannon_Maelstrom_Two=Questionable rage embodied in the Hypervelocity Kinetic Cannon "Maelstrom". Version Two with improved performance and reliability.
