TIGunTemplate.description.HypervelocityKineticCannon_Maelstrom_Three=Unleashed rage embodied in the Hypervelocity Kinetic Cannon "Maelstrom". Version Three with cutting-edge enhancements and unmatched power.

TIGunTemplate.displayName.ResonantMaelstrom=Resonant Maelstrom Turret
TIGunTemplate.description.ResonantMaelstrom=An advanced twin-barrel turret system inspired by the groundbreaking Hypervelocity Kinetic Cannon "Maelstrom." Dubbed the "Resonant Maelstrom," this innovative weapon platform leverages advancements in material science, electromagnetic acceleration, and harmonic resonance to deliver devastating kinetic strikes from multiple directions.
