TIGunTemplate.description.ResonantMaelstrom_Two=An advanced twin-barrel turret system inspired by the groundbreaking Hypervelocity Kinetic Cannon "Maelstrom." Dubbed the "Resonant Maelstrom," this innovative weapon platform leverages advancements in material science, electromagnetic acceleration, and harmonic resonance to deliver devastating kinetic strikes from multiple directions.
